				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d6c78d46-1f5a-4e28-9965-bb503c1011fe")
	)
	(text "RF Inductor, this block LC is a notch filter\nI have calculated it by doing:f0=1/2pi*√(LC)= 1750MHz,\nwhich is near to second harmonic 2° is at 1736MHz"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.566 80.772 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "dcddebd2-4b73-497d-8bad-cf77e263d9d5")
	)
	(text "Here the inductor blocks the RF signal, \nso it doesnt go on VR_PA pin which is a DC component,\n while C51 and C52 absorb the remaining RF that passes\n"
